RCI1qichbkaW4pfMN9txZ4bo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=9Zl3mfBiAmRp774aAVVp4A&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQKJjltQOh1d8wlZ1GJL85Z8-guH_l7DlD3TIL8XLMETog&oe=6ABDAAD3", "width": 640, "height": 1136, "id": "10", "resolution": "640x1136"}], "comments": [{"author": "00_.viraj._307", "author_id": "77694768073", "id": "18138952156723029", "text": "Create a dark mode videos, xD", "timestamp": 1790426849, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tymassilu", "author_id": "48022481972", "id": "18095019932111858", "text": "For a growing startup learning the tech it is difficult to know, where the bottleneck is. Even if you do, sometimes none of these typical scaling steps are applicable. It took me ten years to figure out how to efficiently query growing geospatial datasets and I am still not good at it. Often you need more efficient algorithms. Static caching and serving straight from nginx is undertaught", "timestamp": 1790423018, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "alfred_loo_2000", "author_id": "194684909", "id": "18104079230338184", "text": "If you prefer a text version, check out this link. https://aosabook.org/en/v2/distsys.html", "timestamp": 1790419740, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "chetanroy", "author_id": "1971498702", "id": "18353972254220706", "text": "15 years of my work experience and learning condensed into a few minutes. Excellent!! I wish I had this before I started building high performance low latency apps at scale.", "timestamp": 1790414177, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "rochafii", "author_id": "7816284688", "id": "17900605059371847", "text": "WOAAAAAHHHHHHH, SO EPICCCCCCC", "timestamp": 1790412659, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "cherryreddy_sharath", "author_id": "48917417742", "id": "18152846674519711", "text": "\ud83d\ude4c", "timestamp": 1790401983, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ig_raj_._", "author_id": "22413186302", "id": "18116782187100742", "text": "Cleanest Video i have seen on System Design", "timestamp": 1790397487, "like_count": 4}, {"author": "amine_5015", "author_id": "43803349108", "id": "18633989050041061", "text": "Short, sweet, and to the point \ud83d\udd25 that's how I want things done. \ud83d\udc4f", "timestamp": 1790397415, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "winddy.sleepy", "author_id": "356081623", "id": "18127331707816904", "text": "Very well explain, easy understandable. +1 follower", "timestamp": 1790396847, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "thesimpled", "author_id": "49315827442", "id": "18052926506650418", "text": "\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83e\udd52\ud83e\udd52\ud83e\udd52", "timestamp": 1790396847, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "swetakumari2226", "author_id": "4757647811", "id": "18097745351366618", "text": "Wow this video is insanely informative and crazyy. I love it .. \u2764\ufe0f\u2764\ufe0f\u2764\ufe0f", "timestamp": 1790396489, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "choidavid98", "author_id": "1128663441", "id": "18111334763622627", "text": "I love this. Now that AI does all the coding, we should be focusing more on system design", "timestamp": 1790396371, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "nelson.eustaquio", "author_id": "63857604600", "id": "18033000098665869", "text": "Excelente as\u00ed es", "timestamp": 1790394945, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "e1130pm1am", "author_id": "15969404507", "id": "18109653023113640", "text": "What is my purpose \u2026 oh my goshhh \ud83d\ude35\ud83d\ude2d", "timestamp": 1790391770, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tirtakrmh", "author_id": "1339688082", "id": "18115655153520792", "text": "@farhanryd06 \ud83d\ude02", "timestamp": 1790390692, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdrHAI1MrFb/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdrHAI1MrFb/", "webpage_url_basename": "DdrHAI1MrFb", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sin6-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/824390965_14071136